# Nothing here is part of the published package.
#
# Meteor's package source walk (unlike an app's) excludes NEITHER of these by
# default, and every file it finds is added to the isopack as a lazy module.
# Without these entries the built isopack is roughly 150 MB and 167 source
# resources, instead of well under a megabyte and the 7 files this package
# actually ships.

# Dev-only tooling (eslint, markdownlint, husky). Only the `publish-release`
# npm script's `rimraf ./node_modules` kept this out of releases before — a
# procedural guard on an irreversible action.
node_modules/

# The test application, including the self-referential packages/ symlink it
# uses to resolve this checkout.
tests/
